007900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING STRING-IN.
008400
008500 6000-MAIN.
           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 30
               IF BYTE-IN (SUB) = "."
                   MOVE "-" TO BYTE-IN (SUB)
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
